Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository redistributes **no** third-party artifacts. It builds against the
following, which are fetched at build time and are not part of this source tree:

* Binary Ninja Rust API (`binaryninja`, `binaryninjacore-sys`) —
  https://github.com/Vector35/binaryninja-api, Apache License 2.0, pinned to
  commit aa25bfcfd36532ec3850558a58444df7727e297b. Not vendored; cargo fetches it.

* `libbinaryninjacore` — proprietary, part of a Binary Ninja installation. This
  project links against it; it is neither included nor redistributed here, and
  running this software requires your own Binary Ninja Commercial or Ultimate
  license.

Because nothing third-party is redistributed in this tree, this NOTICE carries no
